This appendix collects the principal mathematical objects and notations used throughout the dissertation. Standard references are Murray, Li & Sastry (1994) for screw theory, Featherstone (2008) for spatial dynamics, and van der Schaft & Maschke (2002) for port‑Hamiltonian systems.

