F.5 Gait Pattern Classifier

```python
def classify_gait_phase(theta_segment, pattern_lib):
    mean_theta = theta_segment.mean(axis=1)
    best, min_d = None, np.inf
    for name, (lo, hi, w) in pattern_lib.items():
        if np.all(mean_theta >= lo) and np.all(mean_theta <= hi):
            centroid = (lo + hi) / 2
            d = np.sqrt(np.sum(w * (mean_theta - centroid)**2))
            if d < min_d:
                min_d, best = d, name
    return best, min_d

